@startuml
actor User
participant "Conversation UI" as Web
participant "Workspace API" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB

User -> Web: Save generated output
Web -> API: POST generated_output_id + output_version_id
API -> DB: Verify output/version relationship
API -> DB: Verify owner or outputs.review permission
API -> DB: Insert unique personal saved pointer
DB --> API: SavedOutput
API --> Web: Exact version saved
note over DB
Later output edits create new versions.
The saved pointer does not move silently.
end note
@enduml
